12. Free the `xmlXPathObjectPtr` using `xmlXPathFreeObject`.
13. Free the `xmlXPathContextPtr` using `xmlXPathFreeContext`.
14. Free the `xmlDocPtr` using `xmlFreeDoc`.
15. Return the populated result map.

